<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<title>Feliz Día, Pa</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<style>
  :root{
    --navy-deep: #0B2A2E;
    --navy-mid: #123B40;
    --gold: #D9A24B;
    --gold-bright: #F0C674;
    --cream: #F6EFE1;
    --coral: #C1483B;
    --line: rgba(246,239,225,0.16);
  }

  *{ box-sizing:border-box; }
  html{ scroll-behavior:smooth; }
  body{
    margin:0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 1px 1px, rgba(246,239,225,0.06) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0/22px 22px,
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--navy-deep), var(--navy-mid) 60%, var(--navy-deep));
    color: var(--cream);
    font-family: 'Georgia', 'Iowan Old Style', serif;
    min-height:100vh;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){
    *{ animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; transition-duration: 0.01ms !important; }
  }

  .display{
    font-family: 'Arial Narrow', 'Helvetica Neue Condensed', 'Oswald', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
  .hero{
    min-height: 92vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    text-align:center;
    padding: 6vh 6vw 4vh;
    position:relative;
  }

  .eyebrow{
    font-family: 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
    letter-spacing: 0.35em;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--gold-bright);
    opacity:0.85;
    margin-bottom: 1.2rem;
  }

  h1.hero-title{
    font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 9vw, 6.2rem);
    line-height: 0.92;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--gold-bright);
    text-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(212,166,74,0.25);
  }

  .hero-name{
    font-family: 'Brush Script MT', 'Segoe Script', cursive;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    text-transform:none;
    letter-spacing: normal;
  }

  .hero-sub{
    max-width: 32ch;
    margin-top: 1.4rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    opacity: 0.82;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* ---------- BADGE / SIGNATURE ELEMENT ---------- */
  .badge-wrap{
    margin-top: 4rem;
    perspective: 1200px;
  }

  .badge{
    width: 220px;
    height: 220px;
    position:relative;
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
    transition: transform 0.9s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
    cursor:pointer;
  }
  .badge.flipped{ transform: rotateY(180deg); }

  .badge-face{
    position:absolute; inset:0;
    border-radius:50%;
    backface-visibility:hidden;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-direction:column;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px var(--navy-mid), 0 0 0 8px var(--gold), 0 18px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
  }
  .badge-front{
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, var(--gold-bright), var(--gold) 60%, #a97a2c 100%);
  }
  .badge-front .initial{
    font-size: 4.2rem;
    color: var(--navy-deep);
    font-family: 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
    font-weight:900;
  }
  .badge-front .tag{
    font-size: 0.62rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.25em;
    color: var(--navy-deep);
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }
  .badge-back{
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 35% 30%, var(--coral), #8f2f26 100%);
    transform: rotateY(180deg);
    padding: 1.4rem;
    text-align:center;
  }
  .badge-back p{
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    line-height:1.3;
    margin:0;
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .badge-hint{
    text-align:center;
    font-family: 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    color: var(--cream);
    opacity: 0.55;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  /* ---------- STATS / POWER METER ---------- */
  .stats{
    width:100%;
    max-width: 460px;
    margin: 3.2rem auto 0;
    text-align:left;
  }
  .stat-row{ margin-bottom: 1.3rem; }
  .stat-label{
    display:flex;
    justify-content:space-between;
    font-family:'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    color: var(--gold-bright);
  }
  .stat-track{
    height: 10px;
    background: rgba(246,239,225,0.1);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow:hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .stat-fill{
    height:100%;
    width:0%;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--gold), var(--gold-bright));
    transition: width 1.8s cubic-bezier(.2,.8,.2,1);
  }
  .stat-fill.infinite{
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--coral), var(--gold-bright), var(--coral));
    background-size: 200% 100%;
    animation: shimmer 3.5s linear infinite;
  }
  @keyframes shimmer{
    0%{ background-position: 0% 0; }
    100%{ background-position: 200% 0; }
  }

  .scroll-cue{
    margin-top: 3.5rem;
    font-family:'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.68rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    opacity: 0.4;
    animation: bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }
  @keyframes bob{
    0%,100%{ transform: translateY(0); }
    50%{ transform: translateY(6px); }
  }

  /* ---------- LETTER SECTION ---------- */
  .letter-section{
    padding: 4vh 6vw 10vh;
    display:flex;
    justify-content:center;
  }

  .letter{
    max-width: 620px;
    width:100%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FBF6E9, #F2E8CF);
    color: #2B241A;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.6rem);
    position: relative;
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.4), 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    transform: rotate(-0.6deg);
  }

  .letter::before{
    content:"";
    position:absolute;
    top:-14px; left: 40px;
    width: 70px; height: 28px;
    background: rgba(212,166,74,0.55);
    transform: rotate(-4deg);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
  }

  .letter h2{
    font-family: 'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.15em;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--coral);
    margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
  }

  .letter p{
    font-size: 1.08rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 1.3rem;
  }

  .letter .signature{
    font-family: 'Brush Script MT', 'Segoe Script', cursive;
    font-size: 1.9rem;
    color: var(--coral);
    margin-top: 2rem;
  }

  .letter .ps{
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    font-style: italic;
    opacity: 0.75;
    border-top: 1px dashed rgba(43,36,26,0.25);
    padding-top: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  footer{
    text-align:center;
    padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
    font-family:'Arial Narrow', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

</style>
</head>
<body>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Día del Padre · Edición Especial</div>
    <h1 class="hero-title">Feliz día,</h1>
    <div class="hero-name">Pa</div>
    <p class="hero-sub">Al hombre más fuerte que conozco, y al que más me quiere.</p>

    <div class="badge-wrap">
      <div class="badge" id="badge" onclick="this.classList.toggle('flipped')">
        <div class="badge-face badge-front">
          <div class="initial">J</div>
          <div class="tag">SÚPER PA</div>
        </div>
        <div class="badge-face badge-back">
          <p>Esta medalla es tuya, Pa: por cada vez que fuiste mi fuerza cuando me faltaba la mía.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="badge-hint">toca la medalla ↑</div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats" id="stats">
      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-label"><span>Fuerza</span><span>100%</span></div>
        <div class="stat-track"><div class="stat-fill" data-width="100"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-label"><span>Paciencia conmigo</span><span>98%</span></div>
        <div class="stat-track"><div class="stat-fill" data-width="98"></div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-row">
        <div class="stat-label"><span>Amor</span><span>∞</span></div>
        <div class="stat-track"><div class="stat-fill infinite" data-width="100"></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-cue">TU CARTA ABAJO ↓</div>
  </section>

  <section class="letter-section">
    <div class="letter">
      <h2>Para Pa</h2>
      <p>Pa, hay cosas que no te digo tan seguido como debería, así que te las escribo aquí para que se queden.</p>
      <p>Eres la persona más fuerte que conozco. No solo por lo que cargas con las manos, sino por todo lo que has cargado sin quejarte, para que a mí no me faltara nada.</p>
      <p>Y aun con toda esa fuerza, nunca me has hecho sentir pequeño(a). Al contrario: contigo cerca todo se siente más fácil, más seguro, más nuestro.</p>
     <p>Feliz Día del Padre, Pa. Te quiero muchísimo.</p>
      <div class="signature">Con todo mi cariño, Angel</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>HECHO CON CARIÑO · PARA PA</footer>

<script>
  const fills = document.querySelectorAll('.stat-fill');
  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries)=>{
    entries.forEach(entry=>{
      if(entry.isIntersecting){
        fills.forEach(f=>{ f.style.width = f.dataset.width + '%'; });
        observer.disconnect();
      }
    });
  }, {threshold:0.4});
  observer.observe(document.getElementById('stats'));
</script>

</body>
</html>
